kl 1
physics gates@1
fabric 30x12 layers=ground
region build all
carrier wire ground
lib IN 1x1 { y out wire E0 }
lib XOR 3x3 { a in wire W0 ; b in wire W2 ; y out wire E1 }
cell h0/x1 XOR
cell h0/x2 XOR
cell h1/x1 XOR
cell h1/x2 XOR
cell i1 IN at=edge side=W
cell i2 IN at=edge side=W
net h0/m1 wire : h0/x1.y -> h0/x2.a
net h1/m1 wire : h1/x1.y -> h1/x2.a
net n1 wire : i1.y -> h0/x1.a h1/x1.a
net n2 wire : i2.y -> h0/x1.b h1/x1.b
